# .file-size-baseline - current hard-cap debt for .githooks/check-file-size.sh
#
# Format: relative path<TAB>LOC.
# The gate permits an over-500 LOC file only while it stays at or below its
# recorded LOC. New over-limit files and expanded baseline files fail.
#
# This is RATCHET-ONLY debt: every entry is a hand-authored file that already
# exceeded the 500 LOC hard cap when the gate began actually running (#1132).
# Do NOT raise these numbers. Split files and DELETE the entry as debt retires.
# Optional third field: staged:<issue-or-reason> permits a temporarily
# unratcheted over-limit entry above current LOC while an explicit staged
# cleanup issue owns the remaining split. It never permits sub-500 entries.
# Genuinely generated/output files belong in .file-size-ignore, not here.

